### Register a New User
POST {{hostname}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login with the Registered User
POST {{hostname}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Create a Project (Without Logging In - This should fail with 401!)
POST {{hostname}}/api/project
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Build Task Manager Frontend",
  "description": "Create the components and services in Angular."
}

### Create a Project WITH Authentication Token
# Copy the long token string from your login response paste it below after 'Bearer '
POST {{hostname}}/api/project
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Build Task Manager Frontend",
  "description": "Create the components and services in Angular."
}

### Create a Task within Project 1
POST {{hostname}}/api/task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Design Angular Login UI",
  "description": "Create the forms, input styling, and validation message elements.",
  "priority": "High",
  "projectId": 1
}

### Get All Tasks for Project 1
GET {{hostname}}/api/task/project/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update the Status of Task 1 to "In Progress"
PUT {{hostname}}/api/task/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}
